      "type": "registry:ui",
      "title": "Confirm Dialog",
      "description": "An alert dialog with a ConfirmButton or TypeToConfirm as its confirm action, which closes only after an async onConfirm settles. Includes useConfirm, which returns an awaitable confirm() and a dialog element you render yourself.",
